nd dependencies","status":"completed","activeForm":"Examining existing project structure and dependencies"},{"id":"6ee9346c-092c-4981-a165-76b8d62b21e8","content":"Create biometric data models and domain entities","status":"completed","activeForm":"Creating biometric data models and domain entities"},{"id":"26bd65b3-b1c6-410b-befb-e64bd2e367bb","content":"Implement secure credential storage with Android Keystore","status":"in_progress","activeForm":"Implementing secure credential storage with Android Keystore"},{"id":"cfaf257f-3d4d-4891-b4f5-3d93e5ebe22b","content":"Create biometric authentication manager","status":"pending","activeForm":"Creating biometric authentication manager"},{"id":"54b8ec91-239a-4d73-a09e-6dd59713f20a","content":"Create biometric setup screen UI and ViewModel","status":"pending","activeForm":"Creating biometric setup screen UI and ViewModel"},{"id":"f431111e-a136-44d9-ab5b-fd68d64130e8","content":"Update AuthGateway and repository for biometric support","status":"pending","activeForm":"Updating AuthGateway and repository for biometric support"},{"id":"2d4deeaf-5760-4472-8086-143a0e7b8e57","content":"Update login screen to support biometric authentication","status":"pending","activeForm":"Updating login screen to support biometric authentication"},{"id":"2dfdf3d6-93ea-4a6a-89e3-4ee606315b97","content":"Update navigation to include biometric setup flow","status":"pending","activeForm":"Updating navigation to include biometric setup flow"},{"id":"f11014ba-c2e9-42b4-bf2a-dfc8ae93c90d","content":"Add required permissions and dependencies","status":"pending","activeForm":"Adding required permissions and dependencies"}],"message":"Successfully updated todo list with 9 item(s)"}"},{"role":"assistant","content":[],"tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_01QQ2awKH8hkB3S63KWa8jLG","type":"function","function":{"name":"write","arguments":"{"file_path": "C:/Users/afane/StudioProjects/myfin-android/android/app/src/main/java/com/afaneca/myfin/data/biometric/CryptoManager.kt", "content": "package com.afaneca.myfin.data.biometric\n\nimport android.security.keystore.KeyGenParameterSpec\nimport android.security.keystore.KeyProperties\nimport java.security.KeyStore\nimport javax.crypto.Cipher\nimport javax.crypto.KeyGenerator\nimport javax.crypto.SecretKey\nimport javax.crypto.spec.GCMParameterSpec\nimport android.util.Base64\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\n\n@Singleton\nclass CryptoManager @Inject constructor() {\n \n private val keyStore = KeyStore.getInstance(KEYSTORE_PROVIDER).apply {\n load(null)\n }\n\n companion object {\n private const val KEYSTORE_PROVIDER = \"AndroidKeyStore\"\n private const val KEY_ALIAS = \"MyFinBiometricKey\"\n private const val TRANSFORMATION = \"${KeyProperties.KEY_ALGORITHM_AES}/${KeyProperties.BLOCK_MODE_GCM}/${KeyProperties.ENCRYPTION_PADDING_NONE}\"\n private const val GCM_TAG_LENGTH = 128\n }\n\n fun getOrCreateKey(): SecretKey {\n if (!keyStore.containsAlias(KEY_ALIAS)) {\n val keyGenerator = KeyGenerator.getInstance(\n KeyProperties.KEY_ALGORITHM_AES,\n KEYSTORE_PROVIDER\n )\n \n val keyGenParameterSpec = KeyGenParameterSpec.Builder(\n KEY_ALIAS,\n KeyProperties.PURPOSE_ENCRYPT or KeyProperties.PURPOSE_DECRYPT\n ).apply {\n setBlockModes(KeyProperties.BLOCK_MODE_GCM)\n setEncryptionPaddings(KeyProperties.ENCRYPTION_PADDING_NONE)\n setUserAuthenticationRequired(true)\n setUserAuthenticationParameters(\n 0, // timeout in seconds, 0 means auth required for each use\n KeyProperties.AUTH_BIOMETRIC_STRONG\n )\n }.build()\n \n keyGenerator.init(keyGenParameterSpec)\n keyGenerator.generateKey()\n }\n \n return keyStore.getKey(KEY_ALIAS, null) as SecretKey\n }\n\n fun getEncryptCipher(): Cipher {\n val cipher = Cipher.getInstance(TRANSFORMATION)\n cipher.init(Cipher.ENCRYPT_MODE, getOrCreateKey())\n return cipher\n }\n\n fun getDecryptCipher(iv: ByteArray): Cipher {\n val cipher = Cipher.getInstance(TRANSFORMATION)\n val spec = GCMParameterSpec(GCM_TAG_LENGTH, iv)\n cipher.init(Cipher.DECRYPT_MODE, getOrCreateKey(), spec)\n return cipher\n }\n\n fun encryptData(plaintext: String, cipher: Cipher): Pair<String, String> {\n val encryptedBytes = cipher.doFinal(plaintext.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8))\n val iv = cipher.iv\n \n return Pair(\n Base64.encodeToString(encryptedBytes, Base64.NO_WRAP),\n Base64.encodeToString(iv, Base64.NO_WRAP)\n )\n }\n\n fun decryptData(encryptedData: String, iv: String): String {\n val ivBytes = Base64.decode(iv, Base64.NO_WRAP)\n val cipher = getDecryptCipher(ivBytes)\n val encryptedBytes = Base64.decode(encryptedData, Base64.NO_WRAP)\n val decryptedBytes = cipher.doFinal(encryptedBytes)\n return String(decryptedBytes, Charsets.UTF_8)\n }\n\n fun deleteKey() {\n if (keyStore.containsAlias(KEY_ALIAS)) {\n keyStore.deleteEntry(KEY_ALIAS)\n }\n }\n}\n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"write","tool_call_id":"toolu_01QQ2awKH8hkB3S63KWa8jLG","content":"Wrote contents to C:\Users\afane\StudioProjects\myfin-android\android\app\src\main\java\com\afaneca\myfin\data\biometric\CryptoManager.kt.

When you're done with your current set of changes to this file, you should call the read_lints tool with the specific file path and fix any newly introduced errors."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create the biometric authentication manager:"}],"tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_014ZsAX2ENwq2P2dXJy8XhDC","type":"function","function":{"name":"write","arguments":"{"file_path": "C:/Users/afane/StudioProjects/myfin-android/android/app/src/main/java/com/afaneca/myfin/data/biometric/BiometricAuthManager.kt", "content": "package com.afaneca.myfin.data.biometric\n\nimport android.content.Context\nimport androidx.biometric.BiometricManager\nimport androidx.biometric.BiometricPrompt\nimport androidx.core.content.ContextCompat\nimport androidx.fragment.app.FragmentActivity\nimport com.afaneca.myfin.R\nimport com.afaneca.myfin.domain.model.BiometricAuthResult\nimport dagger.hilt.android.qualifiers.ApplicationContext\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.channels.Channel\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.flow.receiveAsFlow\nimport javax.inject.Inject\nimport javax.inject.Singleton\nimport javax.crypto.Cipher\n\n@Singleton\nclass BiometricAuthManager @Inject constructor(\n @ApplicationContext private val context: Context,\n private val cryptoManager: CryptoManager,\n) {\n\n private val biometricManager = BiometricManager.from(context)\n\n fun isBiometricAvailable(): Boolean {\n return when (biometricManager.canAuthenticate(BiometricManager.Authenticators.BIOMETRIC_STRONG)) {\n BiometricManager.BIOMETRIC_SUCCESS -> true\n else -> false\n }\n }\n\n fun isBiometricEnrolled(): Boolean {\n return biometricManager.canAuthenticate(BiometricManager.Authenticators.BIOMETRIC_STRONG) == \n BiometricManager.BIOMETRIC_SUCCESS\n }\n\n suspend fun authenticateForEncryption(\n activity: FragmentActivity,\n password: String\n ): BiometricAuthResult {\n if (!isBiometricAvailable()) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.NotAvailable\n }\n\n if (!isBiometricEnrolled()) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.NotEnrolled\n }\n\n val cipher = try {\n cryptoManager.getEncryptCipher()\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.Failure\n }\n\n val resultChannel = Channel<BiometricAuthResult>(Channel.CONFLATED)\n\n val promptInfo = BiometricPrompt.PromptInfo.Builder()\n .setTitle(context.getString(R.string.biometric_setup_title))\n .setSubtitle(context.getString(R.string.biometric_setup_subtitle))\n .setNegativeButtonText(context.getString(R.string.cancel))\n .setAllowedAuthenticators(BiometricManager.Authenticators.BIOMETRIC_STRONG)\n .build()\n\n val cryptoObject = BiometricPrompt.CryptoObject(cipher)\n\n val biometricPrompt = BiometricPrompt(\n activity,\n ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(context),\n object : BiometricPrompt.AuthenticationCallback() {\n override fun onAuthenticationSucceeded(result: BiometricPrompt.AuthenticationResult) {\n super.onAuthenticationSucceeded(result)\n result.cryptoObject?.cipher?.let { authenticatedCipher ->\n try {\n val (encryptedPassword, iv) = cryptoManager.encryptData(password, authenticatedCipher)\n // The encrypted data will be handled by the calling code\n resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Success(encryptedPassword))\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Failure)\n }\n } ?: resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Failure)\n }\n\n override fun onAuthenticationError(errorCode: Int, errString: CharSequence) {\n super.onAuthenticationError(errorCode, errString)\n resultChannel.trySend(\n if (errorCode == BiometricPrompt.ERROR_USER_CANCELED || \n errorCode == BiometricPrompt.ERROR_NEGATIVE_BUTTON) {\n BiometricAuthResult.Cancelled\n } else {\n BiometricAuthResult.Failure\n }\n )\n }\n\n override fun onAuthenticationFailed() {\n super.onAuthenticationFailed()\n // Don't close the channel here, user can retry\n }\n }\n )\n\n biometricPrompt.authenticate(promptInfo, cryptoObject)\n\n return resultChannel.receive()\n }\n\n suspend fun authenticateForDecryption(\n activity: FragmentActivity,\n encryptedPassword: String,\n iv: String\n ): BiometricAuthResult {\n if (!isBiometricAvailable()) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.NotAvailable\n }\n\n if (!isBiometricEnrolled()) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.NotEnrolled\n }\n\n val cipher = try {\n val ivBytes = android.util.Base64.decode(iv, android.util.Base64.NO_WRAP)\n cryptoManager.getDecryptCipher(ivBytes)\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n return BiometricAuthResult.Failure\n }\n\n val resultChannel = Channel<BiometricAuthResult>(Channel.CONFLATED)\n\n val promptInfo = BiometricPrompt.PromptInfo.Builder()\n .setTitle(context.getString(R.string.biometric_login_title))\n .setSubtitle(context.getString(R.string.biometric_login_subtitle))\n .setNegativeButtonText(context.getString(R.string.cancel))\n .setAllowedAuthenticators(BiometricManager.Authenticators.BIOMETRIC_STRONG)\n .build()\n\n val cryptoObject = BiometricPrompt.CryptoObject(cipher)\n\n val biometricPrompt = BiometricPrompt(\n activity,\n ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(context),\n object : BiometricPrompt.AuthenticationCallback() {\n override fun onAuthenticationSucceeded(result: BiometricPrompt.AuthenticationResult) {\n super.onAuthenticationSucceeded(result)\n result.cryptoObject?.cipher?.let { authenticatedCipher ->\n try {\n val decryptedPassword = authenticatedCipher.doFinal(\n android.util.Base64.decode(encryptedPassword, android.util.Base64.NO_WRAP)\n ).toString(Charsets.UTF_8)\n resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Success(decryptedPassword))\n } catch (e: Exception) {\n resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Failure)\n }\n } ?: resultChannel.trySend(BiometricAuthResult.Failure)\n }\n\n override fun onAuthenticationError(errorCode: Int, errString: CharSequence) {\n super.onAuthenticationError(errorCode, errString)\n resultChannel.trySend(\n if (errorCode == BiometricPrompt.ERROR_USER_CANCELED || \n errorCode == BiometricPrompt.ERROR_NEGATIVE_BUTTON) {\n BiometricAuthResult.Cancelled\n } else {\n BiometricAuthResult.Failure\n }\n )\n }\n\n override fun onAuthenticationFailed() {\n super.onAuthenticationFailed()\n // Don't close the channel here, user can retry\n }\n }\n )\n\n biometricPrompt.authenticate(promptInfo, cryptoObject)\n\n return resultChannel.receive()\n }\n}\n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"write","tool_call_id":"toolu_014ZsAX2ENwq2P2dXJy8XhDC","content":"Wrote contents to C:\Users\afane\StudioProjects\myfin-android\android\app\src\main\java\com\afaneca\myfin\data\biometric\BiometricAuthManager.kt.

