### Domain Layer - New Result Types

**`SaveBiometricCredentialsUseCase.SaveResult`** (for biometric setup):
```kotlin
sealed interface SaveResult {
 data object Success
 data object NotAvailable
 data object NotEnrolled
 data object Cancelled
 data class Failure(val reason: String? = null)
}
```
- Maps `EncryptionSuccess` → `Success` at line 29
- Only exposes business-relevant outcomes to the ViewModel

