- ViewModel never sees encrypted/decrypted passwords! ✅

**Simplified `LoginViewModel`:**
- **Before**: 58 lines orchestrating 3 different use cases
- **After**: 35 lines with simple error handling
- No knowledge of encryption/decryption process ✅
- Just calls one use case and handles high-level errors

**Removed Redundant Use Cases:**
- ❌ Deleted `AuthenticateWithBiometricUseCase` 
- ❌ Deleted `GetBiometricCredentialsUseCase`
