3. ✅ **`BiometricLoginUseCase`** - Complete biometric login flow (new!)

### Benefits

1. ✅ **Proper encapsulation** - Encryption details never reach ViewModel
2. ✅ **Single point of truth** - All biometric login logic in one place
3. ✅ **Testability** - Easy to test the entire flow in isolation
