- **`fadeOut() + shrinkVertically()`** - Fades out while shrinking to top

The animation will trigger whenever `uiState.isBiometricEnabled` changes. You can customize the animations further with:
- `slideInVertically()` / `slideOutVertically()` for sliding
- `scaleIn()` / `scaleOut()` for scaling
- Custom `animationSpec` for duration/easing
- And many more!

